cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SchemaLink in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SchemaLink: Schema-Guided Information Extraction from Biomedical Text"
abstract: >
  SchemaLink is a dependency-aware multi-step information extraction engine
  that takes a LinkML schema and free-text biomedical passages as input and
  produces grounded, structured knowledge graph annotations conforming to the
  schema. It uses Large Language Models guided by the schema's class-dependency
  DAG and grounds extracted entities to biomedical ontologies via OAK.
